{"ticker":"MPWR","updated":"2026-10-30T22:59:29Z","profile":{"longName":"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc.","shortName":"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.monolithicpower.com","fullTimeEmployees":4501,"marketCap":59543134208,"trailingPE":73.70012,"forwardPE":28.366163,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":18.191341,"pegRatio":0.87,"targetMeanPrice":1799.8,"targetHighPrice":2100.0,"targetLowPrice":1500.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.476,"earningsGrowth":0.858,"grossMargins":0.55195,"operatingMargins":0.30989,"profitMargins":0.24500999,"totalRevenue":3273157888,"beta":1.681,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1714.09,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":833.18,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.67},"summary":"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc. provides semiconductor-based power electronics solutions in China, Taiwan, South Korea, Southeast Asia, Europe, the United States, Japan, and internationally. The company offers direct current (DC) to DC solutions to convert and control voltages within a range of electronic systems, such as cloud-based and on-premises CPU servers and workstations, AI systems, memory, storage solutions, notebooks, infotainment, power sources, home appliances, network infrastructure, and satellite communications. It also provides alternating current (AC) to DC; driver metal-oxide-semiconductor field-effect transistors; power management integrated circuits (ICs); and current limit switch and lighting control products. The company serves storage and computing, enterprise data, automotive, communications, consumer, and industrial end markets through third-party distributors and value-added resellers. Monolithic Power Systems, Inc. was incorporated in 1997 and is based in West Palm Beach, Florida.","summary_zh":"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc. 在中國、台灣、韓國、東南亞、歐洲、美國、日本和國際上提供基於半導體的電力電子解決方案。該公司提供直流 (DC) 到直流解決方案，用於轉換和控制一系列電子系統內的電壓，例如基於雲端的和本地 CPU 伺服器和工作站、人工智慧系統、記憶體、儲存解決方案、筆記型電腦、資訊娛樂系統、電源、家用電器、網路基礎設施和衛星通訊。它還提供交流電（AC）到直流電；驅動器金屬氧化物半導體場效電晶體；電源管理積體電路（IC）；以及限流開關和照明控制產品。該公司透過第三方分銷商和增值經銷商為儲存和運算、企業數據、汽車、通訊、消費者和工業終端市場提供服務。 Monolithic Power Systems, Inc. 成立於 1997 年，總部位於佛羅裡達州西棕櫚灘。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":811.11,"h":824.97,"l":800.97,"c":823.65,"v":517400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":830.26,"h":830.26,"l":809.54,"c":827.56,"v":432600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":827.56,"h":850.14,"l":817.57,"c":848.11,"v":424500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":853.65,"h":867.22,"l":846.34,"c":865.86,"v":491500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":869.31,"h":879.5,"l":850.66,"c":864.32,"v":495400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":865.71,"h":869.32,"l":848.13,"c":857.87,"v":281900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":868.88,"h":869.7,"l":846.0,"c":855.18,"v":751800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":855.16,"h":860.6,"l":830.37,"c":840.38,"v":576000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":844.96,"h":844.96,"l":830.0,"c":834.14,"v":329700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":838.0,"h":852.54,"l":831.0,"c":849.71,"v":393100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":847.57,"h":860.2,"l":844.63,"c":857.02,"v":401200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":856.42,"h":884.46,"l":850.0,"c":877.66,"v":408400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":895.35,"h":924.4,"l":890.09,"c":917.78,"v":853300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":923.37,"h":923.37,"l":893.07,"c":916.36,"v":1232000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":920.4,"h":938.04,"l":917.79,"c":922.81,"v":416300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":917.64,"h":932.25,"l":907.02,"c":914.27,"v":425500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":920.33,"h":920.33,"l":899.9,"c":908.45,"v":349400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":897.65,"h":898.19,"l":872.29,"c":891.39,"v":336500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":888.55,"h":892.54,"l":877.0,"c":887.55,"v":304300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":908.52,"h":915.65,"l":885.92,"c":886.59,"v":333100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":898.16,"h":929.5,"l":894.38,"c":920.64,"v":505700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":907.37,"h":923.34,"l":894.89,"c":915.87,"v":444000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":927.25,"h":940.11,"l":925.05,"c":930.51,"v":389300},{"t":"2025-10