s://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Truist 因第三季業績強勁而上調 Monolithic Power Systems 股價目標"},{"title":"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc. Provides Earnings Guidance for the Fourth Quarter Ending December 31, 2026","src":"www.marketscreener.com","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc. 提供截至 2026 年 12 月 31 日的第四季獲利指引"},{"title":"Monolithic Power Systems (MPWR) Tops Q3 EPS by 48c; offers guidance","src":"StreetInsider","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQN19KSXlFb2UyZG5scXh4Umw1SURwZ3VrcHhqVVkyaS0zWk1nbEVCWGh4NkRuX2xBLWRTNlgtT2hBRzBTNjM2NkwtZHVPUjk3OVk2TTBfTzVheExQTFVEcXh3WS1nbU9PNmN6LThVUE1CQjJaQlNkbXRfSENJLWxRZXJiTlRZNXNLa0pJOWdUbWtLTGlSZU11d1R0UW03c3JxdXRkcEJ2Q2JqR0pNUXdUc1NnQ19fTklxUTQ2OGVRb0p1ZmZ0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Monolithic Power Systems (MPWR) 第三季 EPS 成長 48c；提供指引"},{"title":"Monolithic Power Systems (NASDAQ:MPWR) delivers impressive Q3, inventory levels improve","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Monolithic Power Systems（納斯達克股票代碼：MPWR）第三季業績令人印象深刻，庫存水準有所改善"},{"title":"[Monolithic Power Systems Q3 2026 Earnings Call] MPS Tops $1 Billion Quarterly Revenue for First Time, Raises Enterprise Data Growth Floor to 150%","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9PN1kzaDdpWHpMQW5tT2pza05aNnRrdEE0M1lSTktudnZsaXZIQnpzR3E0MTRXOHNIM2FiYjNEZVhqOS16UUZnZHZoam02YWFMbmd2eFZVa0ZjV3BrVFE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"[Monolithic Power Systems 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] MPS 季度營收首次突破 10 億美元，將企業數據成長底線提高至 150%"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"分析師評等","count":5}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1280452/000143774926006113/mpwr20251231_10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc. is a fabless global company that provides high-performance, semiconductor-based power electronics solutions. Incorporated in 1997, our three core strengths include deep system-level knowledge, strong semiconductor design expertise, and innovative proprietary technologies in the areas of semiconductor processes, system integration, and packaging. These combined advantages enable us to deliver reliable, compact, and monolithic solutions found in storage and computing, enterprise data, automotive, industrial, communications and consumer applications. Our mission is to reduce energy and material consumption to improve all aspects of quality of life and create a sustainable future. We believe that we differentiate ourselves by offering solutions that are more highly integrated, smaller in size, more energy-efficient, more accurate and more reliable with respect ","zh":"Monolithic Power Systems, Inc. 是一家無晶圓廠全球公司，提供基於半導體的高性能電力電子解決方案。我們成立於 1997 年，擁有三大核心優勢，包括深厚的系統級知識、強大的半導體設計專業知識以及半導體製程、系統整合和封裝領域的創新專有技術。這些綜合優勢使我們能夠提供儲存和運算、企業數據、汽車、工業、通訊和消費應用中可靠、緊湊和整體的解決方案。我們的使命是減少能源和材料消耗，改善生活品質的各個方面，創造可持續的未來。我們相信，我們透過提供整合度更高、尺寸更小、更節能、更準確和更可靠的解決方案來使自己脫穎而出"},{"en":"Semiconductors comprise the basic building blocks of electronic systems and equipment. Within the semiconductor industry, components can be classified either as discrete devices, such as individual transistors, or integrated circuits (\"ICs\"), in which a number of transistors and other elements are combined to form a more complicated electronic circuit. ICs can be further divided into three primary categories: digital, analog, and mixed-signal. Digital ICs, such as memory devices and microprocessors, can store or perform arithmetic functions on data that is represented by a series of ones and zeroes. Analog ICs, in contrast, handle real world signals such as temperature, pressure, light, sound, or speed. In addition, analog ICs also perform power management functions, such as regulating or converting voltages, for electronic devices. Mixed-signal ICs combine digital and analog functions o","zh":"半導體包含電子系統和設備的基本建構模組。在半導體產業中，元件可以分為分立元件（例如單獨的電晶體）或積體電路（“IC”），其中多個電晶體和其他元件組合在一起形成更複雜的電子電路。 IC 可進一步分為三個主要類別：數位、類比和混合訊號。數位 IC，例如儲存裝置和微處理器，可以儲存由一系列 1 和 0 表示的資料或對其執行算術函數。相較之下，類比 IC 處理現實世界的訊號，例如溫度、壓力、光、聲音或速度。此外，類比 IC 也為電子設備執行電源管理功能，例如調節或轉換電壓。混合訊號 IC 結合了數位和類比功能"},{"en":"We focus on the market for high performance analog and mixed-signal solutions. High performance products generally are differentiated by functionality and performance factors, which include integration of higher levels of functionality into a single chip or module, greater precision, better power efficiency and density, higher speed, and lower heat and noise. There are several key factors that distinguish the analog and mixed-signal IC markets from digital IC markets. These factors include longer product life cycles, numerous market segments, technology that is difficult to replicate, relative complexity of design and process technologies, importance of experienced design engineers, lower capital requirements and diversity of end markets. We have targeted product and market areas that we believe allow us to operate at above-average growth over the long term compared to the semiconductor ","zh":"我們專注於高效能類比和混合訊號解決方案市場。高性能產品通常透過功能和性能因素來區分，包括將更高級別的功能整合到單一晶片或模組中、更高的精度、更好的功率效率和密度、更高的速度以及更低的熱量和雜訊。有幾個關鍵因素可以區分類比和混合訊號 IC 市場與數位 IC 市場。這些因素包括較長的產品生命週期、眾多的細分市場、難以複製的技術、設計和製程技術的相對複雜性、經驗豐富的設計工程師的重要性、較低的資本要求和終端市場的多樣性。我們有針對性的產品和市場領域，我們相信與半導體相比，這些領域使我們能夠長期以高於平均水平的增長運營"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"In 2025, three distributors accounted for 26%, 18% and 10% of our total revenue. In 2024, two distributors accounted for 31% and 20% of our total revenue. In 2023, three distributors accounted for 26%, 19% and 10% of our total revenue. No other direct customers accounted for more than 10% of our full-year, total revenue in any of the periods presented.","zh":"2025年，三個經銷商分別占我們總收入的26%、18%和10%。 2024年，兩家經銷商分別占我們總收入的31%和20%。 2023年，三個經銷商分別占我們總收入的26%、19%和10%。在所列任何期間內，沒有其他直接客戶占我們全年總收入的 10% 以上。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The analog and mixed-signal semiconductor industry is highly competitive, and we expect competitive pressures to continue. Our ability to compete effectively and to expand our business will depend on our ability to continue to recruit both applications engineering and design engineering personnel, our ability to introduce new products, our ability to maintain the rate at which we introduce these new products, and our ability to meet our end customers' energy efficiency goals. Our industry is characterized by decreasing average selling prices over the life of a product. We compete with domestic and international semiconductor companies, many of which have substantially greater financial and other resources with which to pursue engineering, manufacturing, marketing, and distribution of their products. In some cases, our competitors have a broader number of product offerings that may enable","zh":"類比和混合訊號半導體產業競爭激烈，我們預期競爭壓力將持續下去。我們有效競爭和擴展業務的能力將取決於我們繼續招募應用工程和設計工程人員的能力、我們推出新產品的能力、我們保持推出這些新產品的速度的能力，以及我們滿足最終客戶能源效率目標的能力。我們產業的特點是在產品生命週期內平均售價不斷下降。我們與國內和國際半導體公司競爭，其中許多公司擁有更多的財務和其他資源來進行產品的工程、製造、行銷和分銷。在某些情況下，我們的競爭對手擁有更多數量的產品，可以使"},{"en":"We are in direct and active competition, with respect to one or more of our product lines, with several manufacturers of such products. We consider our primary competitors to include Analog Devices, Infineon Technologies, NXP Semiconductors, ON Semiconductor, Power Integrations, Renesas Electronics, ROHM Semiconductor, Semtech, STMicroelectronics and Texas Instruments.","zh":"就我們的一條或多條產品線而言，我們與此類產品的多家製造商處於直接和積極的競爭中。我們認為我們的主要競爭對手包括 Analog Devices、Infineon Technologies、NXP Semiconductors、ON Semiconductor、Power Integrations、Renesas Electronics、ROHM Semiconductor、Semtech、STMicroElectronics 和 Texas Instruments。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"CN","val":1544272000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"TW","val":550110000,"zh":"台灣"},{"name":"KR","val":252737000,"zh":"韓國"},{"name":"South East Asia","val":148136000,"zh":"東南亞"},{"name":"Europe","val":113533000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"US","val":96744000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"JP","val":84443000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"Other Region","val":484000,"zh":"其他地區"}],"total":2790459000}},"peers":["ON","MCHP","CDNS","KLAC","LSCC"]}}